			_html("</div><p>The swatches above are rendered with the live tokens on this page — toggle the theme in the header and they follow.</p><h2 id=tokens>Theme Tokens</h2><p>These are defined under <code>:root</code> and re-defined under <code>.dark</code>, then exposed to Tailwind through <code>@theme inline</code>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>What it controls</th><th>Used by</th></tr></thead><tbody>");
